      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "APPELLANT (2) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a one length second (23.28) in a TG1-4W at this track. Good beginner aided by a handy draw. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. SPEECHLESS (6) recorded her 4th career win last time out (23.21) at this track and drawn box 6 for the first time here. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Will go close again if runs up to latest. LINDA LOU (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 400m behind SPEECHLESS (23.99) in a TG1-4W. Was in the money prior to that. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. One of the main contenders. LEKTRA LEE (4) comes into calculations after placing at this track and distance most recently.",
